          <description xml:base="https://kyleparkercunningham.com/oeuvre/printmaking/2021/rocks-glass/">&lt;p&gt;This particular glass was my grandfathers.
He drank from it nightly a 7-up and vodka.&lt;&#x2F;p&gt;
